{"id":"438e32ef2e749226","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-s4-logic.md","title":"S4 Logic","display":"df-s4-logic — S4 Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-s4-logic","aliases":["89-df-s4-logic"],"display":"df-s4-logic — S4 Logic","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-s4-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-s4-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-s4-logic — S4 Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}s4\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{S4}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}s4\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{S4}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}\">\\(\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}\\)</span> 是本书对 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" href=\"?note=64bdfb29fd90b6b0\" title=\"89-df-modal-logic-s4\">89-df-modal-logic-s4</a> 中 S4 的别名。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\varphi \\to \\varphi\">\\(\\Box\\varphi \\to \\varphi\\)</span> : T公理，对应反射性</li>\n<li>S4在反射传递框架上完全</li>\n<li>Gödel 翻译把直觉主义命题逻辑嵌入 S4；这不是两个逻辑公式集的直接包含。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-logic-s4]]).","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-logic-s4","status":"resolved","id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}$ 是本书对 [[89-df-modal-logic-s4]] 中 S4 的别名。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}s4\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{S4}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{S4}^{\\star}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\varphi \\to \\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":737,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-356","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-s4-logic]]"}],"outgoing":["64bdfb29fd90b6b0"]}